1-3. Зарегистрируйтесь на сайте github.com, если еще не сделали этого ранее
Установите параметры git в соответствии с вашими учетными данными.

root@eltex-practice2-v40:~# git config --global user.name "StratumUnit"
root@eltex-practice2-v40:~# git config --global user.name "wotsis2005@gmail.com"
root@eltex-practice2-v40:~# git config --global init.defaultBranch main
root@eltex-practice2-v40:~# apt update
root@eltex-practice2-v40:~# apt install git gh
Reading package lists... Done
Building dependency tree... Done
Reading state information... Done
git is already the newest version (1:2.43.0-1ubuntu7.3).

4. Создайте ключ ssh

root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/.ssh# ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f ~/.ssh/eltex-v40
Generating public/private ed25519 key pair.
Enter passphrase (empty for no passphrase): 
Enter same passphrase again: 
Your identification has been saved in /root/.ssh/eltex-v40
Your public key has been saved in /root/.ssh/eltex-v40.pub

5. Подключите этот комьютер к github

root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/.ssh# gh auth login
? What account do you want to log into? GitHub.com
? What is your preferred protocol for Git operations on this host? SSH
? Upload your SSH public key to your GitHub account? /root/.ssh/eltex-v40.pub
? Title for your SSH key: eltex-practice2-v40
? How would you like to authenticate GitHub CLI? Login with a web browser

! First copy your one-time code: F7A8-BCF1
Press Enter to open github.com in your browser... 
✓ Authentication complete.
- gh config set -h github.com git_protocol ssh
✓ Configured git protocol
! Authentication credentials saved in plain text
✓ Uploaded the SSH key to your GitHub account: /root/.ssh/eltex-v40.pub
✓ Logged in as StratumUnit

6-7. Укажите автоматическую авторизацию только для сайта github.com. Убедитесь, что всё в порядке

root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/.ssh# gh auth setup-git --hostname github.com
root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/.ssh# gh auth status
github.com
  ✓ Logged in to github.com account StratumUnit (/root/.config/gh/hosts.yml)
  - Active account: true
  - Git operations protocol: ssh
  - Token: gho_************************************
  - Token scopes: 'admin:public_key', 'gist', 'read:org', 'repo'

8.  Создайте репозиторий на сервере github

root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/.ssh# gh repo create --public eltex     
✓ Created repository StratumUnit/eltex on GitHub
  https://github.com/StratumUnit/eltex

9. Наполним репозиторий

root@eltex-practice2-v40:~# mkdir ~/eltex && cd ~/eltex
root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/eltex# echo "# Практические работы для школы eltex" >> README.md

root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/eltex# git init
Initialized empty Git repository in /root/eltex/.git/
root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/eltex# git add README.md

root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/eltex# git commit -m "first commit"
[main (root-commit) 3ca6833] first commit
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 100644 README.md
root@eltex-practice2-v40:~/eltex# git branch -M main

iroot@eltex-practice2-v40:~/eltex# git remote add origin https://github.com/StratumUnit/eltex.git 
